# Vulnerabilities found in the upstream imgproxy binary shipped by the base
# image (darthsim/imgproxy:v4.0.14). We cannot patch the upstream binary, and
# neither issue is reachable through our deployment: imgproxy does not serve
# gRPC/xDS (the grpc dep comes from its observability stack) and it does not
# use os.Root on request-controlled paths. Our own binary (usr/local/bin/img-fwd)
# scans clean. Revisit these entries whenever the base image is updated.
GHSA-hrxh-6v49-42gf
CVE-2026-39822
